  "description": "Lumeo is a modern, accessible Blazor component library with 90+ production-ready components. Built on Tailwind CSS v4, it features a comprehensive theming system with dark mode, 30+ chart types via ECharts, DataGrid with advanced features, programmatic overlay service, and full keyboard navigation. Inspired by shadcn/ui and Radix.",
